;   +2 column, +3 row.
; Output: C=1 when no present lantern is at that cell. C=0 when found: the record state becomes 0,
; room_lanterns_left+room is decremented, and A = replacement char AND $7F (the caller draws it and plays the
; pickup sound and score).
